[Aleksi groaning]

599
00:37:19.938 --> 00:37:22.140
[screaming]

600
00:37:31.717 --> 00:37:32.951
Got it.

601
00:37:33.919 --> 00:37:35.321
[Cody]
Hey. fuck that. man.

602
00:37:35.421 --> 00:37:36.864
-let him bleed.
-All right. he's good. then.

603
00:37:36.888 --> 00:37:38.189
-[Aleksi groans]
-Burn him.

604
00:37:39.325 --> 00:37:41.293
