Move. go. go. go. go. go. go!

643
00:41:24.816 --> 00:41:27.018
-[man] Go. go. go. go. go!
-[Cody] Go. go. go. go. go.

644
00:41:28.554 --> 00:41:32.357
Come on. go. go. go. go. go!
Go. go. go. go. go!

